                                   <div type="work" rend="»Dandse, dandse Dukke min!«" xml:id="dandse-dandse-dukke-min" part="N" org="uniform" sample="complete">
<head type="main">»Danse, danse dukke min!«</head>

<p rend="noIndent" xml:id="p_00001" part="N">»Ja, det er nu en vise for meget små børn!« forsikrede tante Malle<?oxy_delete author="as" timestamp="20231113T092601+0100" content=";"?><?oxy_insert_start author="as" timestamp="20231113T092601+0100"?>,<?oxy_insert_end?> »jeg kan med bedste vilje ikke følge med!«</p>

<p rend="firstIndent" xml:id="p_00002" part="N">Men lille Amalie <?oxy_delete author="as" timestamp="20231113T092523+0100" content="kunde"?><?oxy_insert_start author="as" timestamp="20231113T092523+0100"?>kunne<?oxy_insert_end?> det<?oxy_delete author="as" timestamp="20231113T092621+0100" content=";"?><?oxy_insert_start author="as" timestamp="20231113T092621+0100"?>,<?oxy_insert_end?> hun var kun tre år, legede med dukker og opdrog disse til at blive lige<?oxy_insert_start author="as" timestamp="20231113T092614+0100"?> <?oxy_insert_end?>så kloge<?oxy_delete author="as" timestamp="20231113T092636+0100" content=","?> som tante Malle.</p>

<p rend="firstIndent" xml:id="p_00003" part="N">Der kom en student i huset<?oxy_delete author="as" timestamp="20231113T092641+0100" content="; h"?><?oxy_insert_start author="as" timestamp="20231113T092641+0100"?>. H<?oxy_insert_end?>an læste lektier med brødrene<?oxy_delete author="as" timestamp="20231113T092704+0100" content=";"?><?oxy_insert_start author="as" timestamp="20231113T092704+0100"?>,<?oxy_insert_end?> han talte så meget til den lille Amalie og hendes dukker, talte ganske anderledes end alle andre<?oxy_delete author="as" timestamp="20231113T092715+0100" content="; d"?><?oxy_insert_start author="as" timestamp="20231113T092715+0100"?>. D<?oxy_insert_end?>et var så morsomt, fandt den lille, og dog sagde tante Malle<?oxy_delete author="as" timestamp="20231113T092721+0100" content=","?> at han slet ikke forstod at omgås børn<?oxy_delete author="as" timestamp="20231113T092808+0100" content="; d"?><?oxy_insert_start author="as" timestamp="20231113T092808+0100"?>. D<?oxy_insert_end?>e små hoveder <?oxy_delete author="as" timestamp="20231113T092523+0100" content="kunde"?><?oxy_insert_start author="as" timestamp="20231113T092523+0100"?>kunne<?oxy_insert_end?> umuligt bære den snak. Lille Amalie <?oxy_delete author="as" timestamp="20231113T092524+0100" content="kunde"?><?oxy_insert_start author="as" timestamp="20231113T092524+0100"?>kunne<?oxy_insert_end?> det, ja<?oxy_insert_start author="as" timestamp="20231113T092843+0100"?>,<?oxy_insert_end?> lærte endogså udenad af studenten en hel vise: »Danse, danse dukke min!« og hun sang den for sine tre dukker, de to var nye, den ene en frøken, den anden et mandfolk, men den tredje dukke var gammel og hed Lise. Hun fik også sangen at høre og var med i den.</p>



<lg xml:id="p_00004" part="N" org="uniform" sample="complete">
<l part="N">Danse, danse dukke min!</l>
<l part="N">Nej, hvor frøkenen er fin!</l>
<l part="N"><seg target="txtcmnt-284-01" part="N"><!--DATA-TERM: Cavaler(en)--><anchor target="txtcmnt-284-01"/><!--adelig person især i hoftjeneste, hoffunktionær eller en mand i fineste puds.--><?oxy_delete author="as" timestamp="20231113T093002+0100" content="c"?><?oxy_insert_start author="as" timestamp="20231113T093002+0100"?>K<?oxy_insert_end?>avaleren</seg> liges<?oxy_insert_start author="as" timestamp="20231113T093008+0100"?>å<?oxy_insert_end?><?oxy_delete author="as" timestamp="20231113T093009+0100" content="aa"?>,</l>
<l part="N"><?oxy_delete author="as" timestamp="20231113T093013+0100" content="H"?><?oxy_insert_start author="as" timestamp="20231113T093012+0100"?>h<?oxy_insert_end?>an har hat og handsker på,</l>
<l part="N"><?oxy_delete author="as" timestamp="20231113T093014+0100" content="B"?><?oxy_insert_start author="as" timestamp="20231113T093019+0100"?>b<?oxy_insert_end?>ukser hvide, kjole blå,</l>
<l part="N"><?oxy_delete author="as" timestamp="20231113T093023+0100" content="L"?><?oxy_insert_start author="as" timestamp="20231113T093023+0100"?>l<?oxy_insert_end?>igtorn på den store tå.</l>
<l part="N">Han er fin, og hun er fin.</l>
<l part="N">Danse, danse dukke min!</l>
</lg>

<lg xml:id="p_00005" part="N" org="uniform" sample="complete">
<l part="N">Her er gamle Lisemo<?oxy_insert_start author="as" timestamp="20231113T093039+0100"?>r<?oxy_insert_end?><?oxy_delete author="as" timestamp="20231113T093037+0100" content="’er"?>!</l>
<l part="N">Hun er dukke fra i fjor<?oxy_delete author="as" timestamp="20231113T093120+0100" content=";"?><?oxy_insert_start author="as" timestamp="20231113T093120+0100"?>.<?oxy_insert_end?></l>
<l part="N">Håret nyt, det er af hør,</l>
<l part="N"><?oxy_delete author="as" timestamp="20231113T093054+0100" content="P"?><?oxy_insert_start author="as" timestamp="20231113T093055+0100"?>p<?oxy_insert_end?>anden vasket er med smør<?oxy_delete author="as" timestamp="20231113T093129+0100" content=";"?><?oxy_insert_start author="as" timestamp="20231113T093150+0100"?>,<?oxy_insert_end?></l>
<l part="N"><?oxy_delete author="as" timestamp="20231113T093153+0100" content="H"?><?oxy_insert_start author="as" timestamp="20231113T093152+0100"?>h<?oxy_insert_end?>un er ganske ung igen.</l>
<l part="N">Kom du med, min gamle ven!</l>
<l part="N">I skal danse alle tre.</l>
<l part="N">Det er penge værd at se.</l>
</lg>

<pb n="285"/><lg xml:id="p_00006" part="N" org="uniform" sample="complete">
<l part="N">Danse, danse dukke min!</l>
<l part="N">Gør de rette dansetrin!</l>
<l part="N">Foden ud<?oxy_delete author="as" timestamp="20231113T093248+0100" content=" "?>ad, hold dig rank,</l>
<l part="N"><?oxy_delete author="as" timestamp="20231113T093254+0100" content="S"?><?oxy_insert_start author="as" timestamp="20231113T093254+0100"?>s<?oxy_insert_end?>å er du så sød og slank!</l>
<l part="N">Neje, dreje, snurre rundt,</l>
<l part="N"><?oxy_delete author="as" timestamp="20231113T093303+0100" content="D"?><?oxy_insert_start author="as" timestamp="20231113T093302+0100"?>d<?oxy_insert_end?>et er overmåde sundt!</l>
<l part="N">Det er nydeligt at se.</l>
<l part="N">I er<?oxy_delete author="as" timestamp="20231113T093312+0100" content="’"?> søde alle tre!</l>
</lg>
     
     
<p rend="noIndent" xml:id="p_00007" part="N">Og dukkerne forstod visen, lille Amalie forstod den, studenten forstod den<?oxy_delete author="as" timestamp="20231113T093322+0100" content="; h"?><?oxy_insert_start author="as" timestamp="20231113T093322+0100"?>. H<?oxy_insert_end?>an havde selv digtet den og sagde<?oxy_delete author="as" timestamp="20231113T093326+0100" content=","?> at den var så udmærket<?oxy_delete author="as" timestamp="20231113T093331+0100" content="; k"?><?oxy_insert_start author="as" timestamp="20231113T093331+0100"?>. K<?oxy_insert_end?>un tante Malle forstod den ikke; hun var kommet ud over barnlighedens plankeværk, »pjankeværk!« sagde hun, men det var ikke lille Amalie, hun synger den.</p>

<p rend="firstIndent" xml:id="p_00008" part="N">Fra hende har vi den.</p>

<pb n="286"/></div>
